# The build context is deliberately tiny: the image contains the handler, the
# entrypoint, the healthcheck and a constraints file — nothing else. Excluding
# everything first means a new file in this directory cannot leak into a
# published image by accident; it has to be added here on purpose.
*
!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.sh
!handler.py
!healthcheck.py
!requirements.txt

# Belt and braces: never ship a weight cache, a calibration file, a test or a
# local venv even if a pattern above is edited into an include.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/CALIBRATION*.json
**/tests
**/*.gguf
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin
